{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"1591","name":"瑞锦【「机关棋谭」设计人】","desc":"璃月NPC","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/10/75053138/2e9ef353b6331ab11dc539d46eede8a8_3477207346501421347.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"瑞锦","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"性别\",\"value\":[\"女\"]},{\"key\":\"位置\",\"value\":[\"璃月港入口桥内集市旁，传送点附近\"]},{\"key\":\"功能\",\"value\":[\"机关棋谭\"]},{\"key\":\"相关任务\",\"value\":[\"璃月·机关棋谭\"]},{\"key\":\"称号/职业\",\"value\":[\"「机关棋谭」设计人\"]}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"key\":\"编者注\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e机关棋谭真好玩，快来玩呀~（希望常驻）\u003c/p\u003e\"]}],\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/10/75053138/b2ab73f179cd1ac3882d1403c8a55907_8076983829356368391.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"1207","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"NPC截图\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/10/75053138/08d175f8baa2b64b0ecc5049b188a525_5474648939891653844.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1208","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"商品列表","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"1209","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【开场白】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e你好，要来试试「机关棋谭」吗？很有趣的哟！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e【想要玩一局。】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e没问题，随时都可以开始。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e【「机关棋谭」是什么？】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e「机关棋谭」是我刚刚发明出来的一种「棋戏」哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e用一张桌子、几颗棋子和一个主持人就能够玩起来的游戏。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e游戏主题是「用各种方法抵御魔物的进攻」...现在也只有这种主题。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e不过，如果之后有机会，我也想要继续扩展游戏的内容...\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e比如探索遗迹啦、破获案件啦...如果顺利的话，能扩展成「在另一个世界中冒险」就再好不过了...\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e【玩一局要多少钱？】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e嗯...我刚刚把这种「棋戏」做出来，现在主要还是想听大家对于这种「棋戏」的感受...\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e所以，在海灯节期间，玩「机关棋谭」就不收钱了，只需要一盏霄灯就可以玩一局。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e如果你想要玩的话，尽管来找我。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e【再见。】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e嗯，再见。如果想要玩「机关棋谭」的话，尽管来找我吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1210","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_group_info","layout":"","data":"{\"author\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"\",\"list\":[]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1211","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"1212","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1702539836","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2